# Ignore patterns for scanning THIS repository.
#
# Intentionally near-empty. The only CFML here lives in tests/fixtures/ and is
# deliberately vulnerable — the test suite and the CI self-scan job both depend
# on those files being scanned. Do not add a broad pattern such as `*test*`
# here: patterns are matched as an unanchored substring against the whole
# path, so `*test*` would silently disable the entire fixture corpus.
#
# For a starter template to drop into your own project, run:
#     python3 scripts/cfml_sast_simple.py --init-ignore
